      "value": "Full-frame orthographic material swatch of worn muted yellow ochre paint on industrial steel. Broad calm areas of faded ochre paint with sparse dark charcoal paint chips and restrained reddish rust spotting. Brushed hand-painted gouache style, crisp graphic chips, no glossy photographic highlights. Flat uniform diffuse lighting, no perspective, no object outlines, no cast shadows, no text, no bevels, no vignette. Seamless repeating material. Most of the surface is intact paint; wear remains sparse."
